# Always humanize

Before finishing any text edit in this project, run it through the humanizer skill at `.cursor/skills/humanizer/SKILL.md`. This applies to resume content, summaries, bullet points, cover letters, and any prose.

Do not wait for the user to ask. Humanize by default.
